tests {
  test('status is successful', function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.be.oneOf([200]);
  });
}

docs {
  What happened in a workspace, newest first: publishes, account connections and health changes, webhook deliveries, inbox replies, automation runs and billing. Rows are kept for 90 days. Omit workspace_id to read every workspace the caller belongs to. `kind=security` is the audit log — members joining, leaving, changing role or access, and changes to two-step verification, passkeys, single sign-on and signed-in devices. Security rows are append-only and never pruned.

  Requires the `analytics` scope when using an API key.

  **Scope:** `analytics`
}
